# Cloudflare static-assets headers file: https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/headers/
# Limits: 100 rules, 2,000 characters per line. Not validated locally, so check a preview after editing.

# HSTS: after one visit, browsers use HTTPS only for a year. No includeSubDomains
# or preload: they force HTTPS on every subdomain of the zone and are hard to undo.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
